; The @dbt-labs design-system packages (sourdough, dbt-dag, biga) are published to
; GitHub Packages, not the public npm registry. Rebuilding this SPA therefore needs a
; token with `read:packages` exported as GITHUB_TOKEN.
;
; Building the `dbt` binary does NOT need any of this: `web/dist/` is committed and
; `cargo build` embeds it directly. See the crate README.
@dbt-labs:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
